     "Is it possible to produce heatchart (not clustered heatmap) with user\r<br>defined colors for certain data range.\r<br>For ex:\r<br><a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_39NGKVWYg3o/SyqbudJ1_FI/AAAAAAAAA_w/GFyjf4yB4_U/s1600-h/Screen+shot+2009-12-17+at+3.59.12+PM.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_39NGKVWYg3o/SyqbudJ1_FI/AAAAAAAAA_w/GFyjf4yB4_U/s1600-h/Screen%2Bshot%2B2009-12-17%2Bat%2B3.59.12%2BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792380256135000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1jZjhuv1hlXg9sjTj5kyFe\">http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_39NGKVWYg3o/SyqbudJ1_FI/AAAAAAAAA_w/GFyjf4yB4_U/s1600-h/Screen+shot+2009-12-17+at+3.59.12+PM.png</a>"
